-capture-workers/multivariable/14040051/assets/59ef310974793486d22fd5a8967ecb9a2821bf4cd0c1feec1d2094ead812fd38.png)\n\nConsider the graph of the function $f(x),$ shown above. It consists of three line segments. Find the value of ${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305266 1113 #uuid "93aed0bf-b7fc-599f-98ed-952a44f7a56e" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305266 1145 "The graph consists of $3$ parts: the line segment for $x\\in [0,0.5]$, the piecewise linear for $x\\in [0.5,2],$ and the piecewise linear for $x\\in [2,4].$ Therefore, we can write the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={{{\\int }_{0}^{0.5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{1}}+{{{\\int }_{0.5}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{-{A}_{2}}+{{{\\int }_{2}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{3}}\n$$\n\nThe $1$st integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [0,0.5].$ The corresponding region is a right triangle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 0.5\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $2$nd integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [0.5,2].$ The corresponding region is a triangle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the region lies below the $x$-axis, we have \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0.5}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{A}_{2}=-\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\nThe $3$rd integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [2,4].$ The corresponding region is a triangle, so we find the area using the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}-{A}_{2}+{A}_{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}+2 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}+2\\cdot \\frac{2}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{4}{2} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305268 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305269 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305270 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305271 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305272 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1041 "selection" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305268 13194139534718 true] [17592186305267 1110 #uuid "c9b3a652-c261-5e2c-b40d-3dcdc01a2448" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305268 1034 "1" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305268 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534718 true] [17592186305268 1111 #uuid "f8c8aa2c-b77f-50d0-9f89-575c03b2ac58" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305269 1034 "-3" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305269 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534718 true] [17592186305269 1111 #uuid "f00a7472-a6ff-52b5-b1b7-a20f8d6a029b" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305270 1034 "4" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305270 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534718 true] [17592186305270 1111 #uuid "560f0c7b-d3db-5ac0-bf1b-1bf8de1d3935" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305271 1034 "-1" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305271 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534718 true] [17592186305271 1111 #uuid "0ad3e603-0be5-50d6-bcf6-bf26cfe6ceb3" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305272 1034 "5" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305272 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534718 true] [17592186305272 1111 #uuid "78113f49-0dc4-54f9-b918-16a3b4b52e88" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305273 1034 "2" 13194139534718 true] [17592186305273 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534718 true] [17592186305273 1111 #uuid "1d5343d3-05e7-5edb-a3b8-9ce